<title>HONG KONG: Surya Dumai Ind unit sets US$75 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Surya Dumai Ind unit sets US$75 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by arranger BT Asia.</p>
<p>BORROWER  SURYA DUMAI INDUSTRI FINANCE CO BV</p>
<p>GUARANTOR PT SURYA DUMAI INDUSTRI</p>
<p> AMOUNT   US$75 MLN    COUPON    6ML+250 BP  MATURITY  5 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE     FRN	    ISS PRICE PAR	   LAUNCH    05.NOV.96</p>
<p> PUTS     YR 3	   CALLS     NONE	  REPLIES   22.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING  LUXEMBOURG   REPAYMENT BULLET	DENOMS</p>
<p>$100K,$10K</p>
<p>RATING -- SALE LMTS STANDARD TAX PROV --</p>
<p> NEG PLG  YES	    CRS DEF   YES	   FORCE MAJ YES</p>
<p> HOME CTRY INDONESIA   GOV LAW   ENGLISH     PAY DATE  EARLY DEC</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>	  CO-ARRANGER &amp; LEAD MGRS US$10 MLN+ 150 BP  ALL-IN 300 BP</p>
<p>	  CO-LEAD MANAGERS	  US$5-9 MLN 120 BP  ALL-IN 290 BP</p>
<p>	  MANAGERS		    US$2-4 MLN  75 BP  ALL-IN 275 BP</p>
<p>ARRANGER BT ASIA</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
</text>
